Package: TaxisPhenotypeCreator
Title: Automated Clinical Phenotype Creation from TAXIS Knowledge Graph Associations
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Gowtham", "Rao", email = "gowtham.rao@coreason.ai", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Stephen", "Bandeian", email = "sbandeian@gmail.com", role = "aut"),
    person("Shaun", "Grannis", email = "sgrannis@regenstrief.org", role = "aut"),
    person("J. Marc", "Overhage", email = "overhage@gmail.com", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Automated phenotype recreation and synthesizer engine for observational
  health research. Translates structured clinical descriptions and multi-domain
  concept associations from the TAXIS Clinical Knowledge Graph (112 relation codes)
  into computable, standards-compliant OHDSI Circe JSON cohort definitions and target
  DBMS cohort SQL queries. Implements deterministic 4-slot mapping: primary index
  conditions, confirmatory laboratory measurements, indicated first-line
  pharmacotherapies, and rule-out exclusions.
Depends:
    R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports:
    CirceR (>= 1.3.0),
    SqlRender (>= 1.15.0),
    jsonlite (>= 1.8.0),
    readr,
    dplyr
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
